# FloodRoute AI Architecture Rules
- Use Next.js App Router with TypeScript and strict mode.
- Map rendering MUST use `react-leaflet` dynamically imported with `{ ssr: false }`.
- Database operations MUST use the Supabase client SDK with PostGIS queries.
- Do not add Prisma, Docker, or complex custom authentication.
- Never expose SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY to client components.